-- 选词填空 1: 人工智能与就业
('BANKED_CLOZE',
 '<p>The rise of artificial intelligence has sparked an intense debate about its <b>1._____</b> on the job market. While some experts predict massive job <b>2._____</b>, others argue that AI will primarily transform existing roles rather than eliminate them entirely. Historical <b>3._____</b> from previous technological revolutions suggest that new categories of employment eventually <b>4._____</b> to replace those that become obsolete.</p><p>The key to <b>5._____</b> in this changing landscape lies in education and continuous skill development. Workers who <b>6._____</b> in routine, predictable tasks face the highest risk of displacement. Meanwhile, roles requiring creativity, emotional intelligence, and <b>7._____</b> problem-solving abilities are expected to grow in demand. Governments worldwide are being urged to <b>8._____</b> in reskilling programs to prepare their workforce for the <b>9._____</b> changes ahead. The transition may be challenging, but with proper preparation, societies can <b>10._____</b> the benefits of AI while minimizing its disruptions.</p>',
 '[{"label":"A","text":"impact"},{"label":"B","text":"displacement"},{"label":"C","text":"evidence"},{"label":"D","text":"emerge"},{"label":"E","text":"thriving"},{"label":"F","text":"engage"},{"label":"G","text":"complex"},{"label":"H","text":"invest"},{"label":"I","text":"profound"},{"label":"J","text":"harness"},{"label":"K","text":"decline"},{"label":"L","text":"rapid"},{"label":"M","text":"pursue"},{"label":"N","text":"temporary"},{"label":"O","text":"acquire"}]',
 'A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,I,J',
 '1. impact(影响) - AI对就业市场的影响 2. displacement(取代) - 大规模工作岗位被取代 3. evidence(证据) - 历次技术革命的历史证据 4. emerge(出现) - 新类型就业最终出现 5. thriving(繁荣发展) - 在不断变化的环境中繁荣发展 6. engage(从事) - 从事例行可预测任务的工作者 7. complex(复杂的) - 复杂的问题解决能力 8. invest(投资) - 投资再培训项目 9. profound(深远的) - 即将到来的深远变革 10. harness(利用) - 利用AI的益处',
