-- 选词填空 2: 气候变化
('BANKED_CLOZE',
 '<p>Climate change represents one of the most <b>1._____</b> challenges of our time. The scientific <b>2._____</b> is overwhelming: global temperatures are rising at an unprecedented rate, primarily due to human activities. The burning of fossil fuels releases greenhouse gases that <b>3._____</b> heat in the atmosphere, creating a warming effect that disrupts weather patterns worldwide.</p><p>The consequences are already <b>4._____</b> in many regions. Rising sea levels threaten coastal communities, while extreme weather events such as hurricanes, droughts, and floods have become more <b>5._____</b> and intense. Agricultural systems face <b>6._____</b> from changing precipitation patterns, potentially threatening food security for millions. Despite these warnings, global efforts to <b>7._____</b> emissions have been insufficient. Many nations have made <b>8._____</b> to reduce their carbon footprint, but the gap between promises and action remains <b>9._____</b>. Experts emphasize that immediate and <b>10._____</b> measures are necessary to avoid the most catastrophic scenarios.</p>',
 '[{"label":"A","text":"pressing"},{"label":"B","text":"consensus"},{"label":"C","text":"trap"},{"label":"D","text":"visible"},{"label":"E","text":"frequent"},{"label":"F","text":"disruption"},{"label":"G","text":"curb"},{"label":"H","text":"commitments"},{"label":"I","text":"substantial"},{"label":"J","text":"decisive"},{"label":"K","text":"gradual"},{"label":"L","text":"minor"},{"label":"M","text":"release"},{"label":"N","text":"obscure"},{"label":"O","text":"voluntary"}]',
 'A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,I,J',
