('CAREFUL_READING', 'What is the main purpose of the final paragraph?',
 '[{"label":"A","text":"To criticize the slow pace of conservation efforts"},{"label":"B","text":"To emphasize the economic benefits of biodiversity"},{"label":"C","text":"To argue that systemic changes are needed beyond traditional conservation"},{"label":"D","text":"To promote specific policy recommendations"}]',
