 'B', '最后一段: "placing the burden of resistance solely on individuals ignores the structural power of the platforms that have been engineered to be addictive."', 7, '仔细阅读,作者态度'),

('CAREFUL_READING', 'What is the passage main argument about regulation of the attention economy?',
