 'B', '第一段末句明确指出AI systems "reflect the values, assumptions, and biases embedded in their training data and design choices."', 7, '仔细阅读,细节理解'),

('CAREFUL_READING', 'The "black box" problem in AI refers to:',
 '[{"label":"A","text":"The physical appearance of AI hardware"},{"label":"B","text":"The high cost of AI development"},{"label":"C","text":"The difficulty of understanding how AI systems reach their decisions"},{"label":"D","text":"The security vulnerabilities of AI systems"}]',
